m-b-15 f-s-20 l-h-34p c-34304b">财联社12月11日电，大消费股早盘再度拉升，白酒、食品饮料、零售等多个方向大涨，一鸣食品12连板。海欣食品、惠发食品、皇台酒业、李子园、金枫酒业等涨停。中信证券研报指出，临近春节，叠加自上而下不断对内需的重视、政策预期升温，消费有望迎来新一轮反弹修复。</div></div><div class="p-r z-i-5 m-b--1 p-b-11 bg-c-fff"><div class="c-b p-l-23 p-r-30 h-60 l-h-60p bg-c-f6f8f9"><div class="f-l m-l-52 f-s-14 c-222">阅<!-- -->258.26W</div><div class="f-r"><a href="https://service.weibo.com/share/share.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E8%82%A1%E5%86%8D%E5%BA%A6%E6%B4%BB%E8%B7%83%20%E4%B8%80%E9%B8%A3%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%8112%E8%BF%9E%E6%9D%BF&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cls.cn%2Fdetail%2F1885434" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="d-i-b v-a-m m-r-30 w-16 h-13 bg-r-n bg-p-c bg-s-100-100 share-weibo"></a><span class="d-i-b v-a-m w-16 h-13 bg-r-n bg-p-c bg-s-100-100 c-p share-weixin"></span></div></div></div></div><div class="f-r w-280"><div><div class="b-t-w-2 b-t-s-s b-c-222"><div class="p-r-20 p-l-20 h-52 f-s-16 f-w-b l-h-52p c-222">关联话题</div></div><div class="b-t-w-1 b-t-s-s b-c-e6e7ea"><div class="p-t-20 p-r-10 p-b-20 p-l-10 b-b-w-1 b-b-s-s b-c-e6e7ea"><div class="m-l-10"><div class="m-b-3 o-h f-s-20 f-w-b l-h-14 t-o-el w-s-n"><a class="h-t-d-u" href="/subject/1103" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">盘面直播</a></div><div class="f-s-12 c-666">18.32W<!-- --> 人关注</div></div></div><div class="p-t-20 p-r-10 p-b-20 p-l-10 b-b-w-1 b-b-s-s b-c-e6e7ea"><div class="m-l-10"><div class="m-b-3 o-h f-s-20 f-w-b l-h-14 t-o-el w-s-n"><a class="h-t-d-u" href="/subject/1435" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">白酒</a></div><div class="f-s-12 c-666">2.18W<!-- --> 人关注</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="p-f r-20 b-10p z-i-11"><div class="p-r m-b-7 h-33 c-p sidebar-image-box"><img src="https://cdnjs.cls.cn/images/site/cailianWeb/kefu.png" class="w-32"/><img class="d-n p-a t-0 l--242 w-230 ma-w-n sidebar-image" src="https://cdnjs.cls.cn/www/20180717/images/rightSide/kfCodeSlider.png"/></div><div class="p-r m-b-7 h-33 c-p sidebar-image-box"><img src="htt